spend time taking the additional step which is

188
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:05,570
to check whether the chosen word meets all

189
00:10:05,570 --> 00:10:08,250
the criteria in terms of grammar, word form,

190
00:10:08,570 --> 00:10:10,270
meaning, and word limit.

