00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:34,590
and its differences from other question types.

199
00:10:35,310 --> 00:10:37,960
2. Steps for table completion

200
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:41,690
Here are some tips that I want to remind you of.

201
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:45,310
For table completion, always remember to read headings

202
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:47,330
of each column and row carefully.

203
00:10:48,130 --> 00:10:51,020
Make predictions about the word form and grammar

204
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,300
based on the given information in the remaining

205
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:55,750
cells of the same column or row.

